{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["And the sense of <b>and destroy the survivor from the city</b> — from every city, that no survivor will remain from any city in the world. For at first he said: \"and crush all the sons of Sheth\" (Numbers 24:17), and now he says that he will leave neither survivor nor fugitive. And so the counsel that he made known to Balak is brought to completion."], :book :numbers, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:08:26.251449800Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}